4
00:00:14.957 --> 00:00:18.897
Tanga nehutsanana hwemaoko uye zvizivise iwe pachako.

5
00:00:18.897 --> 00:00:19.460
Confirm

6
00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:25.305
kuzivikanwa kwemurwere, tsanangura kuongororwa uye kuwana mvumo yekuzviita.

7
00:00:25.305 --> 00:00:26.140
Pakutanga tora

8
00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:29.841
masekonzi mashoma kuona maziso maviri panguva imwe chete.

9
00:00:29.841 --> 00:00:31.860
Tarisa periorbitor, eyelids uye

10
00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:37.540
maziso, kutaura pane chero kuzvimba, kutsvuka uye kubuda, pamwe nekuzivikanwa kwemaziso

11
00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:39.694
kana nzvimbo isina kujairika yeziso.

12
00:00:39.694 --> 00:00:44.540
Wobva waita ongororo yakakurisa uchishandisa arc mwenje.

13
00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:47.966
Batidza mwenje chena uye bata mudziyo pedyo neziso rako.

14
00:00:47.966 --> 00:00:49.020
Zvishoma nezvishoma swedera pedyo nemurwere

15
00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:51.277
ziso rekurudyi kutanga kusvika ranyatsotarisa.

16
00:00:51.277 --> 00:00:53.252
Izvi zvichange zvakatenderedza 6 cm.

17
00:00:53.252 --> 00:00:54.380
Bvunza murwere kuti

18
00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:58.940
fambisa ziso ravo kunze nemukati, ipapo kumusoro uye pasi, vachibata zvinyoro nyoro maziso avo;

19
00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:03.442
kurongeka vachicherechedza chimiro chakasiyana, vachifunga nezvavo mumapoka.

20
00:01:03.442 --> 00:01:04.260
Wokutanga

21
00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:11.360
Iri boka rinosanganisira eyelashes epamusoro uye epasi uye mavharo evharo, yechipiri inosanganisira conjunctiva.

22
00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:16.220
uye sclera, uye yakaderera forenax.

23
00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:20.552
Boka rechitatu ndiro cornea, mubatanidzwa weiyi ine sclera inonzi

24
00:01:20.552 --> 00:01:21.480
makumbo, uye

25
00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:24.380
Mboni yeziso, akakomberedzwa neiris.

26
00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:29.940
Paunenge wapedza kucherechedza zvese izvi zvimiro, enderera mberi nekuongorora anterior chamber kudzika.

27
00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:34.100
The anterior chamber ndiyo nzvimbo iri pakati pe cornea ne iris.

28
00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:38.514
Nekuvhenekera chiedza kubva kudivi renguva, kudzika kwekamuri yepamberi

29
00:01:38.514 --> 00:01:39.460
inogona kuongororwa.

30
00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:44.220
Mumvuri panasal iris unogona kuratidza kamuri yepamberi isina kudzika.

31
00:01:44.220 --> 00:01:48.380
Uku ndiko kuongorora kwakajairika pasina mumvuri.

32
00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:51.020
Zvino sarudza mwenje webhuruu pane mwenje wearc.

33
00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:56.140
Ne fluorescing dhayi iyo firimu remisodzi, nzvimbo dzekurasikirwa kwe epithelial uye chirwere zvicharatidzwa.

34
00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:59.140
Iyo dhayi fluoresces yakajeka nechiedza chebhuruu.

35
00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:04.200
dhayagiramu saiti uye saizi yenzvimbo dzekurasikirwa kwepithelial uye chirwere.

36
00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:09.300
Yakapedzwa nekuongorora iyo yepamusoro tarsal ndiro, isa donje bud pachivharo chepamusoro,

37
00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:14.400
wosimudza zvinyoro nyoro matinji kumusoro uku uchidzvanya zvishoma nezvishoma pasi nebud.

38
00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:19.920
Pakutanga yakacherechedzwa neziso rakashama, wobva waunza mwenje wearc kuti utaridzike.

39
00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:22.180
Dzokorora kuongorora uku kune rimwe ziso.

40
00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:27.360
Mushure mezvo, tenda murwere, muchidimbu zvinyorwa zvezviwanikwa uye kudzokorora hutsanana hwemaoko.

41
00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:31.360
Ndokumbira utarise kune yedu imwe University yeSt Andrews Arc Chiedza chirongwa mavhidhiyo.
